flowchart TB
    U["<b>Users</b><br/>Contractor · Service Provider<br/>Field Worker · Administrator"]

    FE["<b>Frontend</b> — React on Vercel<br/>React 19 · Vite · React Router<br/>ArcGIS Maps SDK for JavaScript<br/>Browser Geolocation"]

    BE["<b>Backend</b> — FastAPI on Render<br/>17 routers · 86 documented endpoints<br/>JWT Authentication<br/>Role and Project-Level Authorization<br/>Server-Side Distance Validation"]

    DB[("<b>PostgreSQL on Supabase</b><br/>16 tables · 26 foreign key constraints<br/>Project and Operational Data<br/>Work-Zone Geometry — JSON<br/>Planned and Verified Device Coordinates<br/>Attendance and Field Evidence")]

    AGOL["<b>ArcGIS Online</b><br/>Basemaps · Web Maps<br/>Geographic Layers<br/>Planned Traffic Control Device Features"]

    EXT["<b>External Services</b><br/>TomTom Traffic · Twilio WhatsApp<br/>EmailJS · PayPal Sandbox<br/>Anthropic Claude"]

    WEATHER["<b>Open-Meteo</b><br/>Weather Information"]

    BOT["<b>Cloudflare Turnstile</b><br/>Bot Protection"]

    CI["<b>GitHub Actions</b><br/>Automated Backend Testing"]

    REPO["<b>GitHub Repository</b><br/>Production Branch — main"]

    MON["<b>UptimeRobot</b><br/>Backend Availability Monitoring"]

    U --> FE

    FE <-->|"HTTPS · REST API · JSON<br/>JWT for protected requests"| BE

    FE <-->|"Interactive Maps and Layers"| AGOL

    BE <-->|"Planned Device Reference Data"| AGOL

    BE <-->|"SQLAlchemy · Data Persistence"| DB

    BE <-->|"Server-Side Integrations"| EXT

    FE <-->|"Weather Requests"| WEATHER

    FE -->|"Bot Challenge"| BOT

    BE -->|"Token Verification"| BOT

    REPO -->|"Frontend Deployment"| FE

    REPO -->|"Backend Deployment"| BE

    REPO -->|"Pull Request Testing"| CI

    MON -->|"GET / HEAD /health"| BE

